    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Collect equipment and climb upwards to assist Puddles the Duck escape from an erupting volcanic planet in this fast paced rogue-lite vertical platformer. Move quickly to avoid the rising lava flows to help this Space Duck Escape!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run Based Gameplay</h2>Every new run will chose a random set of 9 layers to complete. Every layer introduces a new obstacle to deal with and a new piece of equipment that can assist in clearing those obstacles. While technically possible to complete a run without any equipment, you'll find yourself wanting them as the obstacles combine and increase difficulty.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Interactions</h2>You can equip 2 active and 1 passive for any run. With 9 total unique pieces of equipment, choose wisely to make the best use of your load out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save Files</h2>Your save file will keep track of your best runs and other stats to keep you trying to improve your run times!",
    "about_the_game": "Collect equipment and climb upwards to assist Puddles the Duck escape from an erupting volcanic planet in this fast paced rogue-lite vertical platformer. Move quickly to avoid the rising lava flows to help this Space Duck Escape!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run Based Gameplay</h2>Every new run will chose a random set of 9 layers to complete. Every layer introduces a new obstacle to deal with and a new piece of equipment that can assist in clearing those obstacles. While technically possible to complete a run without any equipment, you'll find yourself wanting them as the obstacles combine and increase difficulty.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Interactions</h2>You can equip 2 active and 1 passive for any run. With 9 total unique pieces of equipment, choose wisely to make the best use of your load out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save Files</h2>Your save file will keep track of your best runs and other stats to keep you trying to improve your run times!",
    "short_description": "Collect equipment and climb upwards to assist Puddles the Duck escape from an erupting volcanic planet in this fast paced rogue-lite vertical platformer. Move quickly to avoid the rising lava flows to help this Space Duck Escape!",
